---
import RewardArtwork from './RewardArtwork.astro';
interface Props { kind: 'templates' | 'feed' | 'carousel' | 'migration' }
const { kind } = Astro.props;
const titles = {templates:'Design the rules. Let the creative change.',feed:'One foundation. Room for each publisher.',carousel:'A small placement. A larger destination.',migration:'The interaction stayed. The way in had to change.'};
---
<figure class:list={['reward-journey',kind]}>
  <reward-journey class="journey-board" data-kind={kind}>
    <header><span>{kind === 'templates' ? 'LOCKSCREEN / CREATIVE SYSTEM' : kind === 'migration' ? 'LOCKSCREEN / DISTRIBUTION PIVOT' : 'FEED / CONNECTED REWARDS'}</span><span>Presentation reconstruction</span></header>
    <h3>{titles[kind]}</h3>
    {kind === 'templates' && <>
      <div class="template-layout">
        <div class="ingredients"><span class="micro">01 / INPUT</span><div class="source-art"><RewardArtwork /></div><div class="source-copy"><small>Advertiser content</small><strong>A different perspective.</strong><p>Artwork, title and description.</p></div><p class="explanation">The brand supplies the material. The system gives it a repeatable place.</p></div>
        <div class="mini-phone"><div class="phone-status">12:31 <span>••• ▰</span></div><div class="lock-clock">12:31<small>Monday, December 5</small></div><div class="creative-output"><RewardArtwork /><small>SPONSORED</small><strong>A different perspective.</strong><p>A little inspiration for your day.</p></div><div class="lock-actions"><span>Unlock</span><i>○</i><span>Explore</span></div></div>
        <div class="system-rules"><span class="micro">02 / ASSEMBLY</span><div><b>Keep the material</b><p>Give the incoming image a defined area.</p></div><div><b>Set the hierarchy</b><p>Separate creative, message and sponsorship.</p></div><div><b>Protect the way out</b><p>Keep unlocking distinct from engaging.</p></div><span class="micro">03 / REPEAT</span><div class="variation-row"><RewardArtwork variant={1}/><RewardArtwork variant={2}/></div></div>
      </div>
    </>}
    {kind === 'feed' && <>
      <div class="feed-layout"><div class="feed-phone" data-preview>
        <div class="phone-status">9:41 <span>••• ▰</span></div><div class="feed-header"><small>YOUR REWARDS</small><strong>Something worth<br/>coming back for.</strong></div><div class="feed-tabs"><b>Discover</b><span>Shopping</span><span>My points</span></div>
        {[0,1].map((v)=><div class="offer-card"><RewardArtwork variant={v}/><div><span><strong>{v===0?'A different perspective.':'Make room for something new.'}</strong><small>Explore the offer · Sponsored</small></span><b class="points">+112P</b></div></div>)}
      </div><div class="feed-reasoning"><span class="micro">ADAPT THE EXPRESSION</span><p class="big-line">A publisher’s identity.<br/>A shared reward experience.</p><p class="explanation">The accent changes. The relationship between creative, title and reward stays recognizable.</p><div class="theme-controls" role="group" aria-label="Preview Feed appearance"><button type="button" data-theme="light" aria-pressed="true">Light</button><button type="button" data-theme="dark" aria-pressed="false">Dark</button></div><div class="accent-controls" role="group" aria-label="Preview publisher accent"><button type="button" data-accent="#b7442c" aria-pressed="true">Terracotta</button><button type="button" data-accent="#316b59" aria-pressed="false">Forest</button><button type="button" data-accent="#69529a" aria-pressed="false">Violet</button></div><div class="decision"><span class="micro">THE DESIGN DECISION</span><p>Bounded customization makes a shared SDK possible. Every partner should not require a new product.</p></div></div></div>
    </>}
    {kind === 'carousel' && <>
      <div class="carousel-context"><div class="publisher-heading"><span>Publisher app</span><b>Rewards for your next moment.</b><small>A native placement within the host experience</small></div>
        <div class="carousel-rail" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Illustrative native ads followed by the Feed entry card">
          {[0,1].map(v=><div class="native-card"><RewardArtwork variant={v}/><div><strong>{v===0?'A different perspective.':'Something new to discover.'}</strong><small>Sponsored <b>+112P</b></small></div></div>)}
          <div class="more-card"><span class="micro">THERE IS MORE TO EXPLORE</span><strong>A few offers<br/>are only<br/>the beginning.</strong><button type="button" data-open-feed>See the Feed</button></div>
        </div><div class="rail-controls"><button type="button" data-end>Show the final card</button><button type="button" data-start>Back to the first ad</button></div>
      </div>
      <div class="feed-destination" hidden tabindex="-1"><div><span class="micro">THE SHARED DESTINATION</span><strong>The Feed</strong><button type="button" data-close-feed>Back to the placement</button></div><div class="destination-grid">{[0,1,2].map(v=><div><RewardArtwork variant={v}/><p>Discover another offer <b>+112P</b></p></div>)}</div></div>
      <ol class="flow-notes"><li><span>01 / ENCOUNTER</span><p>A campaign appears within the publisher’s app.</p></li><li><span>02 / BROWSE</span><p>Horizontal cards reveal a small selection.</p></li><li><span>03 / CONTINUE</span><p>The final card opens the larger Feed.</p></li></ol>
    </>}
    {kind === 'migration' && <>
      <div class="migration-timeline"><div><span class="micro">BEFORE / ONE APP</span><div class="app-block"><span>Publisher app</span><div class="embedded">Lockscreen</div></div><p>The lockscreen lived inside the partner relationship.</p></div><div class="deadline"><strong>2</strong><span>months</span><p>to change distribution</p></div><div><span class="micro">BRIDGE / TWO APPS</span><div class="app-pair"><div class="app-block">Publisher<br/>app</div><div class="app-block companion">Lockscreen<br/>app</div></div><p>Another app to install and opt into. More friction, but a way to keep the service available.</p></div></div><div class="migration-steps"><span>Explain the change</span><span>Install the companion</span><span>Opt in</span><span>Return to the lockscreen</span></div>
    </>}
    <footer>{kind === 'migration' ? 'Reconstructed distribution model · The two-month window comes from Max’s account.' : 'Illustrative content and refreshed visual treatment · Interaction and system logic informed by the archive.'}</footer>
  </reward-journey>
  <figcaption>{kind === 'templates' ? 'The template system, illustrated with a fictional campaign.' : kind === 'feed' ? 'Try changing the appearance. Reimagined layouts with sample rewards.' : kind === 'carousel' ? 'Browse the campaigns, then open the Feed from the final card. Interactive reconstruction.' : 'The move to a separate lockscreen app, illustrated.'}</figcaption>
</figure>
<script>
class RewardJourney extends HTMLElement {
 connectedCallback(){
  if(this.dataset.ready)return;this.dataset.ready='true';
  this.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-theme],[data-accent]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>{
   const key=b.hasAttribute('data-theme')?'theme':'accent';
   this.querySelectorAll(`[data-${key}]`).forEach(el=>el.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(el===b)));
   const preview=this.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-preview]');
   if(key==='theme')preview?.classList.toggle('dark',b.dataset.theme==='dark');
   else preview?.style.setProperty('--accent',b.dataset.accent!);
  }));
  const rail=this.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.carousel-rail');
  const scroll=(end:boolean)=>rail?.scrollTo({left:end?rail.scrollWidth:0,behavior:matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches?'instant':'smooth'});
  this.querySelector('[data-end]')?.addEventListener('click',()=>scroll(true));
  this.querySelector('[data-start]')?.addEventListener('click',()=>scroll(false));
  const destination=this.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.feed-destination');
  this.querySelector('[data-open-feed]')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{if(destination){destination.hidden=false;destination.focus();}});
  this.querySelector('[data-close-feed]')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{if(destination)destination.hidden=true;this.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-open-feed]')?.focus();});
 }
}
if(!customElements.get('reward-journey'))customElements.define('reward-journey',RewardJourney);
</script>
<style>
.reward-journey{margin:2.5rem 0}.journey-board{display:block;background:#f0ece4;color:#3d342d;padding:clamp(20px,4vw,42px);overflow:hidden}.feed .journey-board{background:#e9e9ed;color:#30303b}.carousel .journey-board{background:#e7ece8;color:#243e35}.migration .journey-board{background:#282f31;color:#f6f0df}header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;font:9px/1.6 var(--font-mono,monospace);letter-spacing:.08em;border-bottom:1px solid currentColor;padding-bottom:18px}header span:last-child{opacity:.65;letter-spacing:0}.journey-board h3{font:400 clamp(25px,3.5vw,40px)/1.15 Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.04em;max-width:22ch;margin:30px 0 40px}.micro{display:block;font:9px/1.6 var(--font-mono,monospace);letter-spacing:.08em}.template-layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.25fr 1fr;gap:28px;align-items:center}.source-art{margin:18px 0 0;aspect-ratio:5/3}.source-copy{background:#faf8f2;padding:16px}.source-copy small,.source-copy strong{display:block;font:10px/1.5 Arial,sans-serif}.source-copy strong{font-size:16px;margin:10px 0}.source-copy p{font:11px/1.6 Arial,sans-serif;margin:0}.explanation{font:13px/1.75 Arial,sans-serif;color:inherit;opacity:.8}.mini-phone{background:#123e40;border:6px solid #293331;border-radius:30px;padding:16px 13px;color:#fff;min-height:420px;display:flex;flex-direction:column}.phone-status{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font:10px/1 Arial,sans-serif}.lock-clock{font:300 44px/1 Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:28px 0 35px}.lock-clock small{display:block;font:10px/1.6 Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:0;margin-top:6px}.creative-output{overflow:hidden}.creative-output small{display:block;font:8px/1.5 Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.1em;margin:15px 0 8px;opacity:.7}.creative-output strong{font:20px/1.15 Arial,sans-serif}.creative-output p{font:11px/1.6 Arial,sans-serif;opacity:.7}.lock-actions{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-top:auto;padding-top:30px;font:10px Arial,sans-serif}.lock-actions i{font:38px/1 Arial,sans-serif}.system-rules>div:not(.variation-row){border-bottom:1px solid #d2c9bb;padding:18px 0}.system-rules b{font:14px/1.4 Arial,sans-serif}.system-rules p{font:11px/1.6 Arial,sans-serif;margin:5px 0 0}.system-rules>.micro:not(:first-child){margin-top:22px}.variation-row{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:12px}.variation-row :global(svg){width:calc(50% - 4px)}.feed-layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:50px;align-items:center}.feed-phone{--accent:#b7442c;--surface:#fffdf8;--ink:#292927;--muted:#62615e;background:var(--surface);color:var(--ink);border:6px solid #303230;border-radius:30px;padding:18px 15px;max-width:310px;width:100%;margin:auto}.feed-phone.dark .feed-tabs b{color:var(--ink)}.feed-phone.dark{--surface:#24282b;--ink:#f9f3e8;--muted:#c1c1b9}.feed-header{margin:28px 0 20px}.feed-header small{font:8px/1.5 Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--muted)}.feed-header strong{display:block;font:24px/1.1 Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.03em;margin-top:8px}.feed-tabs{display:flex;gap:18px;font:10px/1.5 Arial,sans-serif;border-bottom:1px solid #7775;margin-bottom:18px;padding-bottom:9px}.feed-tabs b{color:var(--accent)}.offer-card{margin-bottom:14px;border:1px solid #7773;border-radius:9px;overflow:hidden}.offer-card>div{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding:12px 9px}.offer-card strong{display:block;font:12px/1.4 Arial,sans-serif}.offer-card small{display:block;font:8px/1.6 Arial,sans-serif;color:var(--muted);margin-top:4px}.points{background:var(--accent);color:white;padding:6px;border-radius:4px;font:11px/1.3 Arial,sans-serif;white-space:nowrap}.big-line{font:28px/1.2 Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.03em}.theme-controls,.accent-controls{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:5px;margin-top:22px}button{font:10px/1.5 var(--font-mono,monospace);border:1px solid #92968c;background:transparent;color:inherit;cursor:pointer;padding:9px 12px;border-radius:0}button:hover{border-color:currentColor}button:focus-visible,.carousel-rail:focus-visible,.feed-destination:focus-visible{outline:2px solid currentColor;outline-offset:4px}button[aria-pressed=true]{background:#343b37;color:white;border-color:#343b37}.accent-controls{margin-top:8px}.decision{border-top:1px solid #c2c2c9;margin-top:30px;padding-top:20px}.decision p{font:14px/1.75 Arial,sans-serif}.carousel-context{background:#fbfbf6;padding:24px;overflow:hidden}.publisher-heading{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px;margin-bottom:24px}.publisher-heading span{font:10px/1.5 var(--font-mono,monospace)}.publisher-heading b{font:24px/1.15 Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-.025em}.publisher-heading small{font:11px/1.6 Arial,sans-serif;color:#5c6e62}.carousel-rail{display:flex;overflow-x:auto;scroll-snap-type:x mandatory;gap:14px;padding:2px 2px 15px;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:#84998a #eff1ea}.native-card,.more-card{flex:0 0 68%;min-width:0;scroll-snap-align:start;border:1px solid #d1dbd3;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden}.native-card>div{padding:16px}.native-card strong{font:18px/1.3 Arial,sans-serif}.native-card small{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font:11px/1.6 Arial,sans-serif;margin-top:10px}.more-card{padding:24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;background:#dbe8da}.more-card strong{font:clamp(24px,4vw,40px)/1.05 Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.04em}.more-card button{align-self:start;background:#244a38;color:white;border:0}.rail-controls{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;margin-top:15px}.rail-controls button{border:0;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:4px;padding:6px 0;font-size:9px}.flow-notes{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:24px;list-style:none;padding:0;margin:35px 0 0}.flow-notes span{font:9px/1.5 var(--font-mono,monospace)}.flow-notes p{font:13px/1.7 Arial,sans-serif}.feed-destination{background:#fffdf7;padding:24px;margin-top:18px}.feed-destination[hidden]{display:none}.feed-destination>div:first-child{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px}.feed-destination strong{font:25px/1 Arial,sans-serif}.destination-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px;margin-top:24px}.destination-grid p{font:10px/1.5 Arial,sans-serif}.destination-grid b{display:block;margin-top:5px}.migration-timeline{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr .65fr 1.2fr;gap:30px;align-items:center}.app-block{border:1px solid #92a59a;padding:24px 16px;border-radius:12px;margin-top:22px;font:14px/1.5 Arial,sans-serif}.embedded{background:#b9c5ae;color:#263d31;padding:25px 10px;margin-top:20px;text-align:center}.app-pair{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}.companion{background:#b9c5ae;color:#263d31}.migration-timeline p{font:12px/1.7 Arial,sans-serif;color:#cbd5cb}.deadline{text-align:center}.deadline strong{display:block;font:90px/1 Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:300}.deadline>span{font:12px/1.5 var(--font-mono,monospace)}.deadline p{font-size:10px}.migration-steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:20px;border-top:1px solid #718278;margin-top:35px;padding-top:20px;counter-reset:step}.migration-steps span{font:11px/1.6 Arial,sans-serif}.migration-steps span:before{counter-increment:step;content:'0' counter(step);display:block;margin-bottom:10px;color:#a7bcae;font-family:monospace}footer{font:9px/1.7 var(--font-mono,monospace);margin-top:32px;padding-top:18px;border-top:1px solid #929b8e;opacity:.8}figcaption{font:.75rem/1.7 var(--font-mono,monospace);color:var(--theme-text-muted);margin-top:12px}
@media(max-width:700px){.template-layout{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px}.ingredients{grid-column:span 2;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:15px;align-items:center}.ingredients>.micro{grid-column:span 2}.source-art{margin:0}.ingredients>.explanation{grid-column:span 2}.mini-phone{min-height:400px}.feed-layout{gap:25px}.migration-timeline{grid-template-columns:1fr}.deadline strong{font-size:65px}.app-block{margin-top:14px}.migration-steps{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}
@media(max-width:500px){header{font-size:8px;flex-direction:column;gap:6px}.template-layout,.feed-layout{grid-template-columns:1fr}.ingredients{grid-column:auto}.mini-phone{width:240px;max-width:100%;margin:auto;min-height:440px}.system-rules{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:15px}.system-rules>.micro{grid-column:span 2}.variation-row{grid-column:span 2}.feed-reasoning{margin-top:15px}.flow-notes{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:5px}.carousel-context{padding:15px}.native-card,.more-card{flex-basis:88%}.native-card strong{font-size:15px}.destination-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.destination-grid :global(svg){max-height:130px}.destination-grid p{font-size:12px}}
</style>
